# The queue's shell entrypoint and Go sources must survive a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true. A CR in `tools/queue/queue` would break the shebang
# under WSL; the Go sources themselves are line-ending agnostic, but pinning
# them keeps diffs and `go vet` output stable across Git Bash and WSL.
# Patterns in this file are relative to tools/queue/.
* text eol=lf
